    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaba khona indlala elizweni, enjengendlala yakuqala ensukwini zikaAbrahama. UIsaka waya eGerari kuAbimeleki inkosi yamaFilistiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasibonakala kuye, yathi: Ungehleli eGibithe, kodwa uhlale elizweni engizakukutshela lona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hlala kulelilizwe, ngizakuba lawe ngikubusise; ngoba ngizakunika wena lenzalo yakho wonke lamazwe, ngiqinise isifungo engasifunga kuAbrahama uyihlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.22.16+GEN.22.17+GEN.22.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 22:16–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizakwandisa inzalo yakho ibe ngangezinkanyezi zezulu, ngiyinike inzalo yakho lamazwe wonke; ngenzalo yakho zizabusiswa izizwe zonke zomhlaba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngoba uAbrahama walalela ilizwi lami, wagcina amazwi ami lemilayo yami lezimiso zami lemithetho yami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaka wahlalake eGerari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadoda aleyondawo ambuza ngomkakhe. Wathi: Ungudadewethu; ngoba wesaba ukuthi: Ungumkami. Wathi: Mhlawumbe amadoda aleyondawo azangibulala ngenxa kaRebeka, ngoba emuhle kakhulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 12:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.20.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esehlale khona isikhathi eside, uAbimeleki inkosi yamaFilistiya walunguza ngewindi, wabona uIsaka edlala loRebeka umkakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbimeleki wambiza uIsaka, wathi: Khangela, impela yena ungumkakho; utsholoni ukuthi: Ungudadewethu? UIsaka wathi kuye: Bengisesaba ukuthi mhlawumbe ngizakufa ngenxa yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbimeleki wathi: Wenzeni kithi na? Bekulula ukuba omunye ebantwini alale lomkakho; ubususibeka icala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbimeleki walaya bonke abantu, wathi: Othinta lumuntu lomkakhe uzabulawa impela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaka walima kulelolizwe, wazuza ngalowomnyaka okuphindwe kalikhulu; iNkosi yambusisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lowomuntu waba mkhulu, lokwakhe kwanda kakhulu waze waba mkhulu sibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waba lemfuyo yezimvu lemfuyo yezinkomo lenceku ezinengi; ngakhoke amaFilistiya aba lomona ngaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonke imithombo ezaziyimbile inceku zikayise ensukwini zikaAbrahama uyise, amaFilistiya ayeyigqibele, ayigcwalisa ngomhlabathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbimeleki wasesithi kuIsaka: Suka kithi, ngoba ulamandla kakhulu kulathi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaka wasesuka lapho, wakha amathente akhe esigodini saseGerari, wahlala khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaka wabuya waphanda imithombo yamanzi ababeyimbile ensukwini zikaAbrahama uyise; ngoba amaFilistiya ayeyigqibele emva kokufa kukaAbrahama. Wayibiza ngamabizo ayibiza ngawo uyise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku zikaIsaka zemba esigodini, zafumana khona umthombo wamanzi agobhozayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abelusi baseGerari bababangisa abelusi bakaIsaka, bathi: Amanzi ngawethu. Ngakho wabiza ibizo lomthombo wathi yiEseki, ngoba baphikisana laye khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zemba omunye umthombo, lawo bawubanga. Wawubiza ngokuthi yiSitina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasuka lapho, wemba omunye umthombo, kodwa lowo kabawubanganga. Wawubiza ngokuthi yiRehobothi, wathi: INkosi isisenzele indawo, sizakwanda elizweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasuka lapho waya eBerisheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yabonakala kuye ngalobobusuku yathi: NginguNkulunkulu kaAbrahama uyihlo. Ungesabi ngoba ngilawe, ngizakukubusisa ngiyandise inzalo yakho ngenxa yenceku yami uAbrahama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakha khona ialtare, wakhuleka ebizweni leNkosi, wamisa khona ithente lakhe; inceku zikaIsaka zemba khona umthombo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbimeleki wasesiya kuye evela eGerari kanye loAhuzathi umngane wakhe loFikoli induna yempi yakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
